# The search tools pointed at a file rather than a directory (D1 round 6):
# a glob whose pattern names it, one that does not, and a grep of it. The
# rows, Ctrl-O, and what the model was sent.
gateway search-roots-turns.json
work toolgroup-ws
wait 4
type search the file
key Enter
wait 4
snap live
key C-o
wait 1.5
snap live-ctrl-o
key Escape
wait 1
gwlog
